  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/655/655-44.htm",
  "statuteText": "655:44 Objections. –\n\nNomination papers made in accordance with the provisions of this chapter shall be regarded as valid and shall be received by the secretary of state unless objection thereto is made in writing no later than the Monday following the last day for the filing of such papers."
